{"title":"Stained Glass","slug":"Stained_Glass","hero":null,"pageid":2829,"revid":16654,"timestamp":"2024-12-22T05:41:37Z","lastEditor":"ForeskinGamer","categories":["Stubs","Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Ore","fields":[{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.55.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p><span>This page is a <span data-unresolved=\"1\">stub</span>!</span><br>\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Stained_Glass?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><span lang=\"RU\">This stained glass is created by using <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dye_Machine/\">Dye Machine</a>, by consuming <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sand/\">Glass</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flowers/\">Dye</a> to paint the glass.</span>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li><span lang=\"RU\">When looking through <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Statistic_Tool/\">Statistic Tool</a>, It does not display properties like <span data-unresolved=\"1\">Ores</span> do.</span></li>\n<li>Stained glass cannot be sold and can only be used for building.</li></ul>"}
